OL,3,ATrump waives several Russia sanctions
OL,4,Aas row with Zelensky intensifies
OL,5,
OL,6,FRelations between Washington and Kyiv
OL,7,Ffrayed last week, after the US struck a
OL,8,Fcontroversial deal to import Russian
OL,9,Fdiesel. Ukraine then accused the Trump
OL,10,Fadministration of withdrawing key
OL,11,Fmilitary support.
OL,23,APub: 17-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
